                <pb facs="0350" n="300" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg300"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pringle to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-10"><hi rendition="#italic">March 10,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>U. S. consul at Tegucigalpa telegraphs that Americans who fought with Vasquez are
                    threatened with expulsion by President Bonilla. Consul Peterson urges my going
                    there on the <hi rendition="#italic">Ranger</hi>. Future complications might be
                    avoided by a strong protest.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
